    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "Most species were grown on trypticase/phytone/yeast extract medium of the following composition: trypticase (BBL), 0.8 g; phytone (BBL), 0.3 g; yeast extract (Difco),0-25g; glucose, 1.0 g; K2HPO4,0.15 g; MgCl2,0.05 g; cysteine.HC1,0.05 g; Tween 80,0.l ml; distilled water, 100 ml; pH adjusted to 6.5-6.7."
